# Local environment variable names (no secrets)

```
APP_ENV=local
SERVER_PORT=8080
DATABASE_URL=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/bookmyspace
DATABASE_USER=bookmyspace
DATABASE_PASSWORD=changeme
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=replace-me-locally-only
JWT_ACCESS_TTL_SECONDS=900
JWT_REFRESH_TTL_SECONDS=2592000
S3_ENDPOINT=
S3_BUCKET=bookmyspace-local
S3_ACCESS_KEY=
S3_SECRET_KEY=
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8080
LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
```

Copy to `.env` locally (never commit `.env`).
